Z||000003||rockcrawl||08-15-2000||07:44 PM||||yeah, I'm workin on it....damn fortunecity!!<P>Well, it seems my fortunecity pictures can't be acessed from a hyperlink on another site, so just copy and past the URL into your browser to see the second and third pictures. The main picture is on Bay-town, so it will dissapear after ten days.<P>More on the scoop. It stands 2" from the body of the car. It can be installed without modiying or damaging the car (can be removed later), and it will be molded in fiberglass. It will require only to be scuffed before painting and instalation. I am considering two options for mounting, 3M tape all around the edges, or two recessed screws in the original vent location, or a combination of both. Personally I think just the tape will be enough, and would look better. Price should be around $35.00 <p>[This message has been edited by rockcrawl (edited 08-15-2000).]||||reg||13
