Z||000008||Phil||08-15-2000||09:12 PM||||Just post the pics with PIP ||||reg||1
Z||000009||rockcrawl||08-15-2000||09:17 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.host.bay-town.com/imgdir/966363129-7924.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.host.bay-town.com/imgdir/966363638-8596.jpg">  <P>I think the 3M foam double sided tape would also prevent the scoop from rubbing the paint off the car where it contacts the body. I don't think it would lift the paint unless the paint was in really poor shape. Chances are it will not be removed anyway, but if need be it could be done without damaging the car. For the pictures I used four small squares of tape and when I was ready to remove it, it was stuck on there pretty good. <P>Phil, what is PIP?<BR> Forget it, I found it!<p>[This message has been edited by rockcrawl (edited 08-15-2000).]||||reg||7
