Z||000016||FIEROCIOUS||08-16-2000||05:13 AM||||My two cents: <BR>I agree that you should make one for each side. Make mounting areas for those of us that like to secure things with bolts and screws. Also, I noticed that the body lines of the panel don't line up with those of the scoop if it were me I would make the body lines mach up, giveing it a more "finished" look! Great idea looks good! ||||reg||1
