Z||000018||mbramble||08-16-2000||10:06 AM||||This is exactly what I have been planning to do.  The only difference was that I plan to make them more the size of the 'larger' scoops and provide some sort of molded in areas where they could be screwed in from the back of the body panel -- or double-sided taped on.  <P>My big problem is figuring out how to build the mold.  Have been doing quite a bit of reading and am actively designing the scoop.  It may be awhile before I am finished but I'm in no great hurry.  I just know that I can make myself a set of scoops like I want for MUCH less than they are sold for commercially.  <P>I salute you on a job well done.  You have come up with an original, and reasonably priced item and I think you'd better get ready to make up a few sets!!  Good luck...<P>||||reg||1
