Z||000035||rockcrawl||08-17-2000||07:26 PM||||I've started making the second scoop, and the final mold for the first one. I will sell them in pairs or singles, whichever you prefer. It will be possible to mount a screen  (1/4" honeycomb mesh like the deck vents?) over the front. We're probably looking at mid-September for the finished scoops to be emerging from the molds. How does $40/ea or $70/pair sound? I think that's a fair price considering the cost of other options and the time I'm putting into these. I can't wait to get the first set on my car! <P>Jon <BR>aka- rockcrawl ||||reg||14
