Z||000039||rockcrawl||08-19-2000||08:36 AM||||As soon as I get the first set done, I'll take some good pictures and post them here and on my website. I'm going to make about 15-20 pairs in the first run. When I have them ready to ship, I'll take orders from you guys via email, on a first come basis. If you posted here saying you want them, I'll contact you first. I really didn't plan on making too many of these (200!!!), nor do I have the time, but I'll try to make enough for everyone on the list who want's them. This is just a hobby for me, so I work on them in my spare time. I should have the molds done this weekend.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
