Z||000060||rockcrawl||01-23-2001||09:44 PM||||Sorry guys, I'm all out and I'm not making any more. Actually I do have two or three unfinished sets without any means for mounting, and a single finished drivers side scoop with the threaded inserts for mounting and the honeycomb screen. The good news is that another forum member will be getting the molds and hopefully making more. Keep watching Ebay over the next few weeks, I'll be selling what I have left.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||7
